{"ticker":"VLTO","updated":"2026-11-14T01:31:57Z","profile":{"longName":"Veralto Corporation","shortName":"Veralto Corp","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Pollution & Treatment Controls","country":"United States","website":"https://www.veralto.com","fullTimeEmployees":17000,"marketCap":28751519744,"trailingPE":29.197529,"forwardPE":24.243233,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.956304,"pegRatio":2.69,"targetMeanPrice":124.625,"targetHighPrice":135.0,"targetLowPrice":100.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.075,"earningsGrowth":0.084,"grossMargins":0.59835,"operatingMargins":0.21496001,"profitMargins":0.17273001,"totalRevenue":5800999936,"beta":0.666,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":119.7,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":80.03,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.44},"summary":"Veralto Corporation provides water analytics, water treatment, marking and coding, and packaging and color solutions worldwide. It operates through two segments, Water Quality (WQ) and Product Quality & Innovation (PQI). The WQ segment offers precision instrumentation and water treatment technologies to measure, analyze, and treat water in residential, commercial, municipal, industrial, research, and natural resource applications under the Hach, Trojan Technologies, ChemTreat, and other brands. This segment also provides water solutions, including chemical reagents, services, and software solutions. The PQI segment offers marking and coding for packaged goods and related consumables; a software solution that provides digital asset management, marketing resource management, and product information management; inline printing solutions for products and packaging with marking and coding systems; design software and imaging systems for the creation of new packaging designs; color management solutions for printed packages and consumer and industrial products; and color standard services for the design industry. This segment sells its products and services through the Videojet, Linx, Esko, X-Rite, and Pantone brands. The company serves industries, such as municipal utilities, food and beverage, pharmaceutical, and industrials. The company was formerly known as DH EAS Holding Corp. an","summary_zh":"Veralto Corporation 在全球提供水分析、水處理、標記和編碼以及包裝和顏色解決方案。它透過兩個部門運作：水質部門 (WQ) 和產品品質與創新部門 (PQI)。 WQ 部門以 Hach、Trojan Technologies、ChemTreat 和其他品牌提供精密儀器和水處理技術，用於測量、分析和處理住宅、商業、市政、工業、研究和自然資源應用中的水。該部門還提供水解決方案，包括化學試劑、服務和軟體解決方案。 PQI 部門為包裝商品和相關消耗品提供標記和編碼；提供數位資產管理、行銷資源管理和產品資訊管理的軟體解決方案；帶有標記和編碼系統的產品和包裝聯線印刷解決方案；用於創建新包裝設計的設計軟體和成像系統；適用於印刷包裝以及消費品和工業產品的色彩管理解決方案；以及設計行業的色彩標準服務。該部門透過 Videojet、Linx、Esko、X-Rite 和 Pantone 品牌銷售其產品和服務。該公司服務於市政公用事業、食品和飲料、製藥和工業等行業。該公司前身為 DH EAS Holding Corp. 和","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"污染與處理控制","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":109.14,"h":109.525,"l":107.75,"c":107.8,"v":1592600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":107.6,"h":108.05,"l":106.001,"c":106.54,"v":1651700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":106.98,"h":108.59,"l":106.26,"c":106.74,"v":2808400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":107.61,"h":107.96,"l":106.78,"c":107.06,"v":1490800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":107.59,"h":108.0,"l":106.42,"c":106.9,"v":3165200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":106.63,"h":107.065,"l":105.695,"c":105.82,"v":1353100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":105.8,"h":106.23,"l":104.67,"c":105.39,"v":879100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":104.99,"h":105.69,"l":104.34,"c":105.63,"v":1548300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":106.0,"h":106.65,"l":104.06,"c":104.49,"v":1127600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":104.66,"h":105.21,"l":103.32,"c":104.63,"v":1132300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":104.57,"h":105.79,"l":104.355,"c":105.08,"v":1292700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":104.62,"h":106.66,"l":104.62,"c":106.61,"v":1652600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":105.96,"h":106.33,"l":104.845,"c":106.04,"v":1845000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":106.48,"h":106.91,"l":105.55,"c":106.46,"v":1221900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":106.22,"h":107.9,"l":106.01,"c":107.14,"v":1134500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":107.015,"h":107.359,"l":105.5,"c":106.1,"v":1084200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":106.12,"h":106.55